From d086cb8af9b52cdac5fca22c546e41efe4ef0a88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krics <krics@localhost>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 15:21:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] generic: rtl8365mb: re-latch the family D SerDes

Replaces my earlier 930-8 with namiltd's version, plus 930-9 on top.

The receiver latches on the DISABLE -> HSGMII edge and only once the
UNIPHY has finished its bring-up, which is after both pcs_config() and
pcs_link_up() have run. Kick the edge from mac_link_up() and retry until
SDS 0x3D reports link - three attempts here, latching around 10 s into
boot. Capped at 15 retries, cancelled in teardown().

Signed-off-by: krics <krics@localhost>
